#~ msgid ""
#~ "KDEMod is an improved version of KDE, an Arch Linux exclusive. Featuring "
#~ "an improved Qt build, compatible with Arch Linux standard Qt's, an "
#~ "improved theme, and lots of addons, KDEMod is the best way to taste the "
#~ "ease and the power of KDE with the simplicity and the power of Arch."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "KDEMod é unha mellora de KDE, exclusivo de Arch Linux. Cunha mellorada "
#~ "compilación de Qt, compatíbel cos estándares de Arch Linux, e ademais un "
